    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this one bedroom ground floor apartment with private patio area to the rear, located in the heart of Carrick on Shannon. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, double bedroom, bathroom and open plan kitchen/dining/living area with patio doors onto private patio area. The property is located in a very well kept apartment complex, private parking, well maintained gardens, tennis courts and within walking distance of all town centre amenities such as shops, restaurants, schools, cinema, leisure centre & some wonderful walkways along the River Shannon. For all viewings please contact Gallagher Auctioneers Ltd on 0719621000."
      },
